    "engine": "knitr",
    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Paired before/after boxplots in R with canvasXpress\"\ndescription: \"Show paired measurements — each subject connected across two timepoints — as an interactive boxplot, by wrapping a ggpubr::ggpaired plot with canvasXpress().\"\nauthor: \"Isaac Neuhaus\"\ndate: \"2026-09-26\"\ncategories: [R, canvasXpress, ggpubr, visualization]\nimage: \"thumbnail.png\"\n---\n\n\n\nWhen the same subjects are measured twice — before/after a treatment, baseline vs follow-up — a\n**paired boxplot** with a line connecting each subject across the two timepoints tells the story a\nplain boxplot can't. This post builds one in R by wrapping a\n[ggpubr](https://rpkgs.datanovia.com/ggpubr/) `ggpaired` plot with\n[canvasXpress](https://canvasxpress.org), so it becomes interactive and reproducible without\nre-specifying anything.\n\n## Install\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\ninstall.packages(c(\"canvasXpress\", \"ggpubr\"))\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n## A paired dataset\n\nLong format, two rows per subject — one per timepoint. Swap in your own repeated-measures table.\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlibrary(ggplot2)\nlibrary(ggpubr)\n\nset.seed(7)\nn  <- 25\ndf <- data.frame(\n  id    = rep(paste0(\"P\", seq_len(n)), 2),\n  time  = rep(c(\"Baseline\", \"Week 12\"), each = n),\n  value = c(rnorm(n, 8, 1.2),                       # baseline\n            rnorm(n, 8, 1.2) + rnorm(n, -1.2, 0.8)) # follow-up (a drop)\n)\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n## Build it with ggpaired, then wrap it\n\n`ggpaired` draws the two boxes and the per-subject connecting lines; `stat_compare_means` adds a\npaired test. Then hand the whole thing to `canvasXpress()`:\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlibrary(canvasXpress)\n\ng <- ggpaired(\n  df, x = \"time\", y = \"value\", id = \"id\",\n  color = \"time\", line.color = \"gray\", line.size = 0.3\n) +\n  stat_compare_means(paired = TRUE, method = \"t.test\")\n\ncanvasXpress(g)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"htmlwidget-aa56dee1de73a15107a4\" style=\"width:100%;height:433px;\" class=\"canvasXpress html-widget\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-aa56dee1de73a15107a4\">{\"x\":{\n  \"renderTo\": \"canvas\",\n  \"data\": [\n    [\"Id\", \"id\", \"time\", \"value\"],\n    [\"1\", \"P1\", \"Baseline\", \"10.7446965936086\"],\n    [\"2\", \"P2\", \"Baseline\", \"6.56387398133318\"],\n    [\"3\", \"P3\", \"Baseline\", \"7.16684898747745\"],\n    [\"4\", \"P4\", \"Baseline\", \"7.50524845863584\"],\n    [\"5\", \"P5\", \"Baseline\", \"6.83519199065662\"],\n    [\"6\", \"P6\", \"Baseline\", \"6.86326406572627\"],\n    [\"7\", \"P7\", \"Baseline\", \"8.89776720834866\"],\n    [\"8\", \"P8\", \"Baseline\", \"7.85965372893542\"],\n    [\"9\", \"P9\", \"Baseline\", \"8.18318915153868\"],\n    [\"10\", \"P10\", \"Baseline\", \"10.6279737287953\"],\n    [\"11\", \"P11\", \"Baseline\", \"8.42838347639483\"],\n    [\"12\", \"P12\", \"Baseline\", \"11.2601021397569\"],\n    [\"13\", \"P13\", \"Baseline\", \"10.7377423111875\"],\n    [\"14\", \"P14\", \"Baseline\", \"8.38882464816622\"],\n    [\"15\", \"P15\", \"Baseline\", \"10.2752804801719\"],\n    [\"16\", \"P16\", \"Baseline\", \"8.56121661358604\"],\n    [\"17\", \"P17\", \"Baseline\", \"6.92743913229747\"],\n    [\"18\", \"P18\", \"Baseline\", \"7.63120604055537\"],\n    [\"19\", \"P19\", \"Baseline\", \"7.99421309327892\"],\n    [\"20\", \"P20\", \"Baseline\", \"9.18579697939993\"],\n    [\"21\", \"P21\", \"Baseline\", \"9.00770043154889\"],\n    [\"22\", \"P22\", \"Baseline\", \"8.8464101970866\"],\n    [\"23\", \"P23\", \"Baseline\", \"9.56715766497403\"],\n    [\"24\", \"P24\", \"Baseline\", \"6.33440454008858\"],\n    [\"25\", \"P25\", \"Baseline\", \"9.52750023710628\"],\n    [\"26\", \"P1\", \"Week 12\", \"6.81083744662969\"],\n    [\"27\", \"P2\", \"Week 12\", \"7.69660139111791\"],\n    [\"28\", \"P3\", \"Week 12\", \"7.80381646819178\"],\n    [\"29\", \"P4\", \"Week 12\", \"6.98606692118486