t hides *who* changed. The connecting lines make within-subject change visible:\na treatment can lower the group median while a handful of subjects still rise — exactly the pattern\nyou want to catch before drawing conclusions.\n\n## Next\n\n- [Use ggplot2 & ggpubr plots directly with canvasXpress](../ggplot-direct/)\n- [Interactive volcano plots in R](../volcano-plots-in-r/)\n- Gallery: <https://canvasxpress.org/examples.html>\n",
